{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-07_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-07","title":"暴君","storyCode":"1-7","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b4f8327901c1a672a1a4beb5a76b12d21c5965e65287ecc680259ca97e5a6e89","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"衝撃に備えろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"総員、散開せよ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"クソッ、規模が大きすぎる！　何もかも破壊し尽くさんばかりの勢いだ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"このままではまずいぞ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"急いで退避するんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"は、はい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ来るぞ、踏ん張れ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ひっ……！　あ、ぁ……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空が……空が、落ちてくる……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ぐっ……！　い……痛い……身体が、痛い……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手が……俺の手がない！　う、あああっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"は、はは……どうして……どうしてこんなことに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"い、嫌だ、死にたくない、死にたく……あああああああっ！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、重装オペレーター！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"術師の保護に回れ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――！？　なっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"一体何の音だ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"隕石だ、かなりデカい――クソッ、通り沿いに落ちた！　伏せろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"きゃっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　建物が、倒れて――！　危ない！　そこを離れてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"こっちだ、早く！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......!","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"――あっ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"いたっ……ド、ドクター……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"つ、突き飛ばして逃がしてくれたのか！？　……だけど、それじゃドクターが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"――ッ、危ない！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……えっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"待っ……ニアールさん、無茶です！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――伏せろ、ドクター！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ、はあ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"間に合ったようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　生きてる！　よかった、二人とも生きてるぞ！！　さすがニアールさん……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……ふぅ、はぁっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ニアールさん！　ドクター！　早くこちらへ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"私は大丈夫だ！　先に行け、ドクター！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"この盾は、まだ持ちこたえられる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"だから跳ぶんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ためらうな、早く！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だ、大丈夫ですか？　お怪我はありませんか？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大丈夫。このくらい、大したことじゃない。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"ああ。ニアールに感謝しないとな。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……あなたという人は……もうあんな真似はしないでくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"仮に無茶をするにしても、まず私に声をかけてもらえねば、守れるものも守れなくなってしまうだろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"もとより、どのような状況でも、あなたが傷付くことなど容認できないが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"私の目の前でとなれば、なおのこと見過ごせない。……どうか、そのことを理解しておいてほしい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……とにかく今は、みなさんが無事でよかったです……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ただ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（あとどれだけ持ちこたえられるのか……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（本当に、生き延びることができるのか……どうにも、不安は尽きないけれど……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……はぁ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……？　なんだか、降ってくる隕石が減ったような……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"天災の第一波は越えた、ということでしょうか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……まだ、気を抜くわけにはいかん。この天災がどれだけ続くかは未知数だからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"とはいえ……天災の中心からは抜け出せたと見ていいだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ひとまず、乗り切ったようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、動けそうですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"はい！　オペレーター全員、大きな問題はありません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"一部怪我人もいますが、いずれも軽傷です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺たち……生き延びたんですね……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ア……う、ぁあ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンにも、無事な人が――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……お前……ら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ぁ……ああああっ！！　ロドス……ロドスの奴らだ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……ッ、なんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"アァ……ぁ……う、アアアアアア！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか、まだ戦うつもりなんでしょうか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……ロドス……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……殺せ……ロドスを殺せ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、こいつら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"逃すな……殺せ……始末しろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"イカれた連中め……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"なぜこのようなことを……命が惜しくないのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドーベルマンさん、これは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。……ほかに道はないようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"素早く対処し、先を急ぐぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"sp